Package: vegasr
Title: Multidimensional Numerical Integration using Vegas+ 
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given="Fraser", family="Lewis", email="fraser.iain.lewis@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides access from R to the most recent and efficient vegas algorithm, vegas+, implemented via wrapping the Python package <https://pypi.org/project/vegas/> by the algorithm author G. P. Lepage. Application area is aimed at Bayesian computation with relevant functions included. 
